{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter's New Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Meeting Farmani", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Making And Responding To Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When talking to people you know or do not know, it is important to be polite when you ask for something. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can make requests by using: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Can you ...?</li> <li>Could you ... ?</li> <li>Will you ... ? </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>Do you mind ... ? </li> <li>Is it OK if I ... ?</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can respond to requests by saying: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Sure, here you are.</li> <li>Absolutely.</li> <li>Okay. </li> <li>Not at all. </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Things to remember when making a request</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u201cWould you mind ... ?\u201d and \u201cDo you mind ... ?\u201d are followed by <span class=\"italic\"> \u2018verb + -ing'</span><br/>\u201cCan  you ... ?\u201d, \u201cCould you ... ?\u201d, \u201cWill you ... ?\u201d, \u201cIs it OK if I ... ?\u201d are followed by a <span class=\"italic\">base form verb</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Do you mind</span> send<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> me the reports?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Not at all.  </span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could you tell me</span> a bit more about it? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Absolutely</span>. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Starting And Ending A Phone Conversation ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " It is common that English speakers make phone calls either for business purposes or personal reasons. These are expressions you can use when having conversations on the phone. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Answering the phone</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Introducing yourself</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hello? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Thank you for calling Polygon. How can I help you?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Hey Giorgio. It's Marie calling. (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Hello, this is Janet Ellison calling.</li> <li>Hi, it's Farmani from Holly's here.</li> <li>This is she *</li> <li>Speaking *</li></ul> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">(You say this when the caller is asking for you or does not recognize your voice)</li>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Asking to speak to someone</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Connecting someone </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Is Janet in? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span></span>) <li>Is Janet there, please? (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span></span>) <li>Could I speak to Janet, please? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Just a sec. I'll get him (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">informal</span>)</li> <li>Hang on a second. </li> <li>Please hold.</li> <li>One moment please.\\t</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Making special requests</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Ending a conversation</span>  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Could you please repeat that?</li> <li>Would you mind telling me more about that? </li> <li>Can you call me back? I think we have a bad connection. </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>Thanks for calling. Bye for now.</li> <li>I'll talk to you again soon. Bye. </li> <li>I have to let you go now.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "CEO", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for Chief Executive Officer, the person with the most authority in a large company ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is Mr. Farmani, CEO of Holly's.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when having conversations on the phone in the workplace. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "agency", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a business that provides a particular service for people or organizations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Holly's is looking into hiring a PR agency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mid-range", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not the most expensive or the cheapest ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We offer a mid-range of clothing. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a number of shops owned or managed by the same  person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are more than 300 stores in our chain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "department store", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large shop that is divided into separate departments, each selling a different type of goods", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are a mid-range chain of department stores.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to look into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to try to find out about something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are looking into hiring a PR firm.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to play a role", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have an influence on something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We want a PR firm that will play a role in managing our company's communication. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "proposal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plan which is presented to a company to consider", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you mind sending me a proposal with your ideas?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (70-80 words) about a phone conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use expressions to start a phone conversation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Within the phone conversation, include a request and a response to that request. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember to use phrases to keep the conversation going and to the end the conversation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I start and end a conversation on the phone. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make and respond to requests on the phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use phrases to keep the conversation going.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can start and end a conversation on the phone. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make and respond to requests.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can keep the conversation going.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How do you keep a conversation going? What do you say?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Is it important to ask a lot of questions when you are having a conversation? Why or why not? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Could you tell me about your company? ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"